[00:30.68]1. Jehovah, you always have been,
[00:35.74]And always you will be.
[00:42.66]You’ve given the throne to your Son;
[00:47.40]He rules by your decree.
[00:54.72]The Kingdom has been brought to birth;
[01:00.00]His rulership will fill the earth.
[01:05.10](Chorus)
[01:05.62]For now have come to pass
[01:09.54]Salvation and kingdom and might.
[01:14.22]The Kingdom is in place.
[01:18.74]We pray: “Let it come, Let it come!”
[01:23.56]2. The time for the Devil is short;
[01:30.96]We know what this will mean.
[01:35.14]Though living in times of distress,
[01:39.40]We see the things unseen.
[01:44.22]The Kingdom has been brought to birth;
[01:48.80]His rulership will fill the earth.
[01:53.62](Chorus)
[01:54.00]For now have come to pass
[01:57.84]Salvation and kingdom and might.
[02:02.78]The Kingdom is in place.
[02:07.32]We pray: “Let it come, Let it come!”
[02:19.56]3. The angels in heaven rejoice
[02:23.84]And sing with joyful cries.
[02:28.60]The heavens above are relieved
[02:32.44]From Satan and his lies.
[02:37.10]The Kingdom has been brought to birth;
[02:41.64]His rulership will fill the earth.
[02:48.00](Chorus)
[02:48.00]For now have come to pass
[02:51.92]Salvation and kingdom and might.
[02:57.38]The Kingdom is in place.
[03:01.40]We pray: “Let it come, Let it come!”
